      "question_index": 1,
      "question_type": "MCQ",
      "question_text": "$\\sum_{n=1}^{4}(-1)^{2n} \\cdot i^{2n}=$",
      "question_html": "<div class=\"q-body\"> <div class=\"question q-prose\"><!-- HTML_TAG_START --> $\\sum_{n=1}^{4}(-1)^{2n} \\cdot i^{2n}=$ <!-- HTML_TAG_END --></div></div>",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "A",
          "text": "$2$",
          "html": "<div class=\"option-content question\"><!-- HTML_TAG_START --> $2$ <!-- HTML_TAG_END --></div>"
        },
        {
          "label": "B",
          "text": "$-i$",
          "html": "<div class=\"option-content question\"><!-- HTML_TAG_START --> $-i$ <!-- HTML_TAG_END --></div>"
        },
        {
          "label": "C",
          "text": "$0$",
          "html": "<div class=\"option-content question\"><!-- HTML_TAG_START --> $0$ <!-- HTML_TAG_END --></div>"
        },
        {
          "label": "D",
          "text": "$i$",
          "html": "<div class=\"option-content question\"><!-- HTML_TAG_START --> $i$ <!-- HTML_TAG_END --></div>"
        }
      ],
      "correct_answer": "C",
      "explanation_text": "$(-1)^{2n}$ is always equal to $1$ , because the power $2n$ is even. So, $(-1)^{2n} \\cdot i^{2n}=1 \\cdot i^{2n}=i^{2n}$ Now use $i^{2}=-1$ . $i^{2n}=(i^{2})^{n}=(-1)^{n}$ So the given sum becomes $\\sum_{4}^{n=1}(-1)^{n}$ Now put $n=1,2,3,4$ : $(-1)^{1}+(-1)^{2}+(-1)^{3}+(-1)^{4}$ $=-1+1-1+1$ $=0$ So the correct option is $0$ Option C.",
      "explanation_html": "<div class=\"question q-prose\"><!-- HTML_TAG_START --><p> $(-1)^{2n}$  is always equal to  $1$ , because the power  $2n$  is even.</p>\n<p>So,</p>\n<p> $(-1)^{2n} \\cdot i^{2n}=1 \\cdot i^{2n}=i^{2n}$ </p>\n<p>Now use  $i^{2}=-1$ .</p>\n<p> $i^{2n}=(i^{2})^{n}=(-1)^{n}$ </p>\n<p>So the given sum becomes</p>\n<p> $\\sum_{4}^{n=1}(-1)^{n}$ </p>\n<p>Now put  $n=1,2,3,4$ :</p>\n<p> $(-1)^{1}+(-1)^{2}+(-1)^{3}+(-1)^{4}$ </p>\n<p> $=-1+1-1+1$ </p>\n<p> $=0$ </p>\n<p>So the correct option is</p>\n<p> $0$ </p>\n<p>Option C.</p><!-- HTML_TAG_END --></div>",
      "has_image": false,
