      "question_text": "If $3x+i(4x-y)=6-i$ where $x$ and $y$ are real numbers, then the values of $x$ and $y$ are respectively,",
      "question_html": "<div class=\"q-body\"> <div class=\"question q-prose\"><!-- HTML_TAG_START --><p>If  $3x+i(4x-y)=6-i$  where  $x$  and  $y$  are real numbers, then the values of  $x$  and  $y$  are respectively,</p><!-- HTML_TAG_END --></div></div>",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "A",
          "text": "3, 9",
          "html": "<div class=\"option-content question\"><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->3, 9<!-- HTML_TAG_END --></div>"
        },
        {
          "label": "B",
          "text": "2, 4",
          "html": "<div class=\"option-content question\"><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->2, 4<!-- HTML_TAG_END --></div>"
        },
        {
          "label": "C",
          "text": "2, 9",
          "html": "<div class=\"option-content question\"><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->2, 9<!-- HTML_TAG_END --></div>"
        },
        {
          "label": "D",
          "text": "3, 4",
          "html": "<div class=\"option-content question\"><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->3, 4<!-- HTML_TAG_END --></div>"
        }
      ],
      "correct_answer": null,
      "explanation_text": "$3x+i(4x-y)=6-i$ On comparing real and imaginary parts of LHS and RHS, we get $\\begin{aligned} 3x & =6\\text{and}4x-y=-1 \\\\ \\Rightarrow 3x & =6 \\Rightarrow x=2 \\end{aligned}$ Put $x=2$ into $4x-y=-1$ , we get $\\begin{aligned} & 4 \\times 2-y=-1 \\\\ \\Rightarrow & 8+1=y \\Rightarrow y=9 \\end{aligned}$",
      "explanation_html": "<div class=\"question q-prose\"><!-- HTML_TAG_START --><p> $3x+i(4x-y)=6-i$ </p>\n<p>On comparing real and imaginary parts of LHS and RHS, we get</p>\n<p> $\\begin{aligned} 3x &amp; =6\\text{and}4x-y=-1 \\\\ \\Rightarrow 3x &amp; =6 \\Rightarrow x=2 \\end{aligned}$ </p>\n<p>Put  $x=2$  into  $4x-y=-1$ , we get</p>\n<p> $\\begin{aligned} &amp; 4 \\times 2-y=-1 \\\\ \\Rightarrow &amp; 8+1=y \\Rightarrow y=9 \\end{aligned}$ </p><!-- HTML_TAG_END --></div>",
      "has_image": false,
      "image_urls": [],
